Apache-2.0 directories within this repository
---------------------------------------------

packages/integration-sdk/  — the normative integration contracts (data, not code)
.harness/                  — a vendored copy of aiosbrain/aios-engineering-harness,
                             which `aios repo-bootstrap` stamps into target repositories

Each carries its own LICENSE and NOTICE explaining why. `.harness/` was initially held back
